        "raw": "Seems solid, although both tactics are something I see heroes using regularly anyway against any old villain.  I suspect using Y/R abilities early will be more common and impactful than Risky basics.\n\nOnly niggle I have is that the villains aren't really going to be able to get benefits this way.  Their abilities are almost always better choices than any Risky basic would be, and of course they don't have GYRO abilities.",
